  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-41301" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Master Plan for Sustainable Agriculture in the Abu Dhabi Emirate</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ADAFSA requested FAO to support the development of a Master Plan, aiming at identifying goals, targets, and develop a roadmap to promote the sustainable development of the agricultural sector in Abu Dhabi. By assisting ADAFSA to develop a Master Plan for the agricultural sector, the project contributes to the NFSS, approved by the Council of Ministers in May 2018 to strengthen food security. The NFSS lays the foundations to transform the food and agriculture sectors in the country. The Master Plan will provide a clear roadmap for the development of the agricultural sector in the three regions of Abu Dhabi Emirate (Al Ain, Al Dhafra and Abu Dhabi) and will promote a rollout of related investment programmes and concrete actions.</narrative>
  </description>
